From ef5e030e2156b8845dace9c9c61d3c557cc4be10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:27:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 118/140] feat(browser): add configurable video and folder
 swipe actions

Add expressive swipe feedback, folder-wide actions, manual video marks, and localized settings. Preserve explicit New and cleared labels with a non-destructive database migration.
